    "以上为一般性健康科普,不构成医学诊断或治疗建议。PCOS 的诊断与管理请咨询专业医生。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The above is general wellness information, not a medical diagnosis or treatment advice. For diagnosis and management of PCOS, please consult a qualified doctor."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "以上为一般性健康科普,不构成医学诊断或治疗建议。PCOS 的诊断与管理请咨询专业医生。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "以上为一般性健康科普,基于你记录的阶段为估算,不构成医学建议或诊断,也不可作为避孕或备孕的依据。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The above is general wellness information; phases are estimated from your records. It is not medical advice or diagnosis, and not a basis for contraception or conception."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "以上为一般性健康科普,基于你记录的阶段为估算,不构成医学建议或诊断,也不可作为避孕或备孕的依据。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "以上为基于个人记录的统计学估算,仅供参考,不构成医学建议。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "These are statistical estimates based on your own records. For reference only — not medical advice."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "以上为基于个人记录的统计学估算,仅供参考,不构成医学建议。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "以上阶段与日期为基于你的记录的统计预测,仅供参考;不构成医学建议,不可作为避孕或备孕依据。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Estimated from your own records — for reference only. Not medical advice, and not for contraception or conception."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "以上阶段与日期为基于你的记录的统计预测,仅供参考;不构成医学建议,不可作为避孕或备孕依据。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
