    "订阅会自动续期,可在 App Store 账户设置中随时取消。买断为一次性付款,永久有效。所有交易由 Apple 处理,我们不接触你的支付信息。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Subscriptions renew automatically and can be canceled anytime in your App Store account settings. Lifetime is a one-time payment, valid forever. All transactions are handled by Apple; we never see your payment details."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "订阅会自动续期,可在 App Store 账户设置中随时取消。买断为一次性付款,永久有效。所有交易由 Apple 处理,我们不接触你的支付信息。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "让 Maren 在本机发现属于你的规律。数据从不离开你的设备。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Let Maren discover your own patterns on-device. Your data never leaves your device."
          }
