            "value": "No medications or supplements yet. Tap ＋ in the top right to add one — e.g. Metformin, Inositol, Vitamin D."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "还没有添加任何用药或补剂。点右上角「＋」加一个,比如二甲双胍、肌醇、维生素 D。"
          }
        }
      }
