    "这会清空 %lld 条经期记录和 %lld 条每日记录,且无法恢复。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This will erase %1$lld period records and %2$lld daily logs. This cannot be undone."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
